{"name":"表格","description":"表格是按行和列展示同一组字段、便于比较多条记录的数据组件 · 订单、成员和库存可放进表格逐列比较。排序、筛选和分页需明确反馈当前状态；列很多时还要处理小屏和横向滚动。","quote":"订单数据堆在一起太乱了，帮我排成表格，一行一条。","agentPrompt":"请把订单列表整理成表格，一行一笔订单，固定展示编号、金额、状态和时间，保留现有筛选。手机端优先保留关键列，其余信息可横向查看或进入详情。请验证排序后各列仍对应同一订单。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-table\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>表格<span>Table</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">订单数据堆在一起太乱了，帮我排成表格，一行一条。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">表格是按行和列展示同一组字段、便于比较多条记录的数据组件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>订单、成员和库存可放进表格逐列比较。排序、筛选和分页需明确反馈当前状态；列很多时还要处理小屏和横向滚动。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"table-demo\">\n    <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">项目</span><span class=\"t-cell\">状态</span><span class=\"t-cell t-sort\">更新时间 ↓</span></div>\n    <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">官网改版</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">进行中</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">刚刚</span></div>\n    <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">年报设计</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag green\">已完成</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">昨天</span></div>\n    <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">支付重构</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag red\">已逾期</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">3 天前</span></div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把订单列表整理成表格，一行一笔订单，固定展示编号、金额、状态和时间，保留现有筛选。手机端优先保留关键列，其余信息可横向查看或进入详情。请验证排序后各列仍对应同一订单。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>多行同构数据</b>需要逐列比较，如用户、订单、日志</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:56px;color:var(--text-3)\">任务</span><span style=\"width:44px;color:var(--text-3)\">状态</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:56px;color:var(--text)\">登录页</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">进行中</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:56px;color:var(--text)\">支付流</span><span class=\"mk-tag green\">已完成</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要<b>排序、筛选</b>才能快速找到目标数据</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"flex:1.3;color:var(--text-3)\">名称</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text);font-weight:600\">价格 ↑</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">库存</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.3;color:var(--text)\">键盘</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">¥ 99</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">210</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.3;color:var(--text)\">鼠标</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">¥ 199</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">86</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">每行都要带<b>行内操作</b>：编辑、删除、查看</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"flex:1.2;color:var(--text-3)\">项目</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">状态</span><span style=\"flex:1.2;color:var(--text-3)\">操作</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.2;color:var(--text)\">官网改版</span><span style=\"flex:1\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">进行中</span></span><span style=\"flex:1.2\"><span class=\"mk-link\">编辑</span> <span class=\"mk-link\">删除</span></span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.2;color:var(--text)\">年报设计</span><span style=\"flex:1\"><span class=\"mk-tag green\">已完成</span></span><span style=\"flex:1.2\"><span class=\"mk-link\">编辑</span> <span class=\"mk-link\">删除</span></span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>后台管理页</b>的主体视图，配合搜索和批量操作</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-input\"><em>🔍 搜索用户名</em></span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">新建用户</span></div><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">林小hu</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag orange\">管理员</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">阿油</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">成员</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只有<b>少量行和字段</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/descriptions?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"descriptions\" aria-label=\"描述列表 Descriptions\">描述列表 <b>Descriptions</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">字段</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">值</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text)\">版本</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text)\">v2.4.0</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">就一行数据，表头比内容还重</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">内容是<b>图文混排的信息流</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/list?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"list\" aria-label=\"列表 List\">列表 <b>List</b></a> 或 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"card\" aria-label=\"卡片 Card\">卡片 <b>Card</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:40px;height:28px;border-radius:4px;flex:none\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text);flex:none\">新品发布</span><span style=\"flex:1;min-width:60px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:95%\"></i></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">图和段落挤进格子，全变形了</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">手机窄屏直接显示过多列，导致频繁横向滚动</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-phone\" style=\"width:96px;height:132px;padding:8px 7px;gap:5px;overflow:hidden\"><span class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">项目</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">状态</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">负责人</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">时间</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">操作</span></span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:150%;flex:none\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:150%;flex:none\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">列太多，手机上得一直左右滑</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只展示层级时用<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/tree?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"tree\" aria-label=\"树形控件 Tree\">树形控件 <b>Tree</b></a>；还要比较多列时再考虑树形表格</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"flex:1.4;color:var(--text-3)\">名称</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">大小</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.4;color:var(--text)\">src/</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">—</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.4;color:var(--text);padding-left:14px\">components/</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">—</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">层级关系只靠缩进表示，父子归属不清楚</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:360px\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"head\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">项目</span><span class=\"t-cell\">状态</span><span class=\"t-cell\">负责人</span></div></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"row\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cell\"><span class=\"t-cell\">官网改版</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">进行中</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">林小hu</span></div></span>\n    </div></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">表格</span><span class=\"pe\">Table</span></button><span class=\"pd\">整张表：一个表头 + 若干数据行</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"head\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">表头</span><span class=\"pe\">Header</span></button><span class=\"pd\">说明每列含义，排序入口也在这</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"row\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">数据行</span><span class=\"pe\">Row</span></button><span class=\"pd\">一行就是一条记录</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"cell\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">单元格</span><span class=\"pe\">Cell</span></button><span class=\"pd\">行列交叉的最小格子，内容要克制</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">基础表格<span>Basic</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">名称</span><span class=\"t-cell\">库存</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">键盘</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">鼠标</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">数据量不大、没有特殊需求时的默认选择</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">斑马纹<span>Striped</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"table-demo striped\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">名称</span><span class=\"t-cell\">库存</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">键盘</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">鼠标</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">行数较多时，使用条纹帮助区分相邻行</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">紧凑<span>Compact</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"table-demo compact\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">名称</span><span class=\"t-cell\">库存</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">键盘</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">鼠标</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">显示器</span><span class=\"t-cell\">42</span></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">一屏要塞进更多行的密集后台场景</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带排序<span>Sortable</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">名称</span><span class=\"t-cell t-sort\">价格 ↑</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">键盘</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥99</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">鼠标</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥199</span></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">用户需要按某列大小快速找目标时</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">后台用户管理</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:170px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px\" placeholder=\"搜索用户名\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1\"></span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">导出</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">＋ 新建用户</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:none\">\n        <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">用户</span><span class=\"t-cell\">角色</span><span class=\"t-cell\">状态</span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">林小hu</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">管理员</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag green\">正常</span></span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">阿油</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">成员</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag red\">已禁用</span></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">订单列表</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div>\n      <div class=\"demo-tabs\" style=\"max-width:none\">\n        <span class=\"tab active\">全部</span><span class=\"tab\">待付款</span><span class=\"tab\">待发货</span><span class=\"tab\">已完成</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;border-top:none\">\n        <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">订单号</span><span class=\"t-cell\">商品</span><span class=\"t-cell\">金额</span><span class=\"t-cell\">状态</span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">2026071801</span><span class=\"t-cell\">无线耳机</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥ 299.00</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag red\">待付款</span></span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">2026071796</span><span class=\"t-cell\">机械键盘</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥ 199.00</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">待发货</span></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">数据报表</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;flex:1\">7 月销售报表</b>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">导出 Excel</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:none\">\n        <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">周次</span><span class=\"t-cell t-sort\">销售额 ↓</span><span class=\"t-cell\">订单数</span><span class=\"t-cell\">环比</span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">第 29 周</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥ 286,400</span><span class=\"t-cell\">3,146</span><span class=\"t-cell\" style=\"color:var(--green);font-weight:600\">↑ 12.5%</span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">第 28 周</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥ 254,600</span><span class=\"t-cell\">2,903</span><span class=\"t-cell\" style=\"color:var(--red);font-weight:600\">↓ 3.2%</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">操作日志</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;flex:1\">操作日志</b>\n        <span class=\"custom-select\" data-custom-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-trigger\" data-custom-select-trigger aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px;min-height:30px\">\n      <span class=\"custom-select-value\" data-custom-select-value>全部操作</span>\n      <i class=\"select-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </button>\n    <span class=\"custom-select-menu\" role=\"listbox\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option on\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-custom-select-option data-value=\"全部操作\">\n        <span>全部操作</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-custom-select-option data-value=\"新建\">\n        <span>新建</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-custom-select-option data-value=\"修改\">\n        <span>修改</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-custom-select-option data-value=\"删除\">\n        <span>删除</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-demo compact\" style=\"max-width:none\">\n        <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">时间</span><span class=\"t-cell\">操作人</span><span class=\"t-cell\">操作</span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">14:32:05</span><span class=\"t-cell\">林小hu</span><span class=\"t-cell\">发布了「官网改版 v2」</span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">14:28:41</span><span class=\"t-cell\">阿油</span><span class=\"t-cell\">删除了文件 旧版首页.sketch</span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">13:56:12</span><span class=\"t-cell\">KK</span><span class=\"t-cell\">修改了成员权限</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/table\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">&lt;table&gt;：表格元素</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/table/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">Table 表格模式</span><span class=\"reference-source\">WAI-ARIA APG ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/table","markdown":"# 表格Table\n\n你可能会说\n订单数据堆在一起太乱了，帮我排成表格，一行一条。\n\n**表格是按行和列展示同一组字段、便于比较多条记录的数据组件**·订单、成员和库存可放进表格逐列比较。排序、筛选和分页需明确反馈当前状态；列很多时还要处理小屏和横向滚动。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请把订单列表整理成表格，一行一笔订单，固定展示编号、金额、状态和时间，保留现有筛选。手机端优先保留关键列，其余信息可横向查看或进入详情。请验证排序后各列仍对应同一订单。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **多行同构数据**需要逐列比较，如用户、订单、日志\n\n任务状态\n\n登录页进行中\n\n支付流已完成\n- 需要**排序、筛选**才能快速找到目标数据\n\n名称价格 ↑库存\n\n键盘¥ 99210\n\n鼠标¥ 19986\n- 每行都要带**行内操作**：编辑、删除、查看\n\n项目状态操作\n\n官网改版进行中编辑 删除\n\n年报设计已完成编辑 删除\n- **后台管理页**的主体视图，配合搜索和批量操作\n\n🔍 搜索用户名新建用户\n\n林小hu管理员\n\n阿油成员\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 只有**少量行和字段**：使用 [描述列表 **Descriptions**](/vibe-hub/descriptions?lang=zh)\n\n字段值\n\n版本v2.4.0\n就一行数据，表头比内容还重\n- 内容是**图文混排的信息流**：使用 [列表 **List**](/vibe-hub/list?lang=zh) 或 [卡片 **Card**](/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh)\n\n新品发布\n图和段落挤进格子，全变形了\n- 手机窄屏直接显示过多列，导致频繁横向滚动\n\n项目状态负责人时间操作列太多，手机上得一直左右滑\n- 只展示层级时用[树形控件 **Tree**](/vibe-hub/tree?lang=zh)；还要比较多列时再考虑树形表格\n\n名称大小\n\nsrc/—\n\ncomponents/—\n层级关系只靠缩进表示，父子归属不清楚\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n项目状态负责人\n\n      \n官网改版进行中林小hu\n\n1表格Table整张表：一个表头 + 若干数据行\n\n2表头Header说明每列含义，排序入口也在这\n\n3数据行Row一行就是一条记录\n\n4单元格Cell行列交叉的最小格子，内容要克制\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n基础表格Basic\n\n名称库存\n\n      \n键盘210\n\n      \n鼠标86\n\n数据量不大、没有特殊需求时的默认选择\n\n斑马纹Striped\n\n名称库存\n\n      \n键盘210\n\n      \n鼠标86\n\n行数较多时，使用条纹帮助区分相邻行\n\n紧凑Compact\n\n名称库存\n\n      \n键盘210\n\n      \n鼠标86\n\n      \n显示器42\n\n一屏要塞进更多行的密集后台场景\n\n带排序Sortable\n\n名称价格 ↑\n\n      \n键盘¥99\n\n      \n鼠标¥199\n\n用户需要按某列大小快速找目标时\n\n典型使用场景\n\n后台用户管理\n\n导出\n        ＋ 新建用户\n\n      \n用户角色状态\n\n        \n林小hu管理员正常\n\n        \n阿油成员已禁用\n\n订单列表\n\n全部待付款待发货已完成\n\n      \n订单号商品金额状态\n\n        \n2026071801无线耳机¥ 299.00待付款\n\n        \n2026071796机械键盘¥ 199.00待发货\n\n数据报表\n\n**7 月销售报表**\n        导出 Excel\n\n      \n周次销售额 ↓订单数环比\n\n        \n第 29 周¥ 286,4003,146↑ 12.5%\n\n        \n第 28 周¥ 254,6002,903↓ 3.2%\n\n操作日志\n\n**操作日志**\n        \n    \n      全部操作\n      \n    \n    \n      \n        全部操作✓\n      \n        新建✓\n      \n        修改✓\n      \n        删除✓\n\n      \n时间操作人操作\n\n        \n14:32:05林小hu发布了「官网改版 v2」\n\n        \n14:28:41阿油删除了文件 旧版首页.sketch\n\n        \n13:56:12KK修改了成员权限\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[<table>：表格元素MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/table)[Table 表格模式WAI-ARIA APG ↗](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/table/)"}